  },
  {
   "start": 1.988,
   "dur": 6.873,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "It's called a candle.",
     "start": 1.988,
     "end": 3.529
    },
    {
     "text": "It's on almost every chart.",
     "start": 3.709,
     "end": 5.892
    },
    {
     "text": "If you can't read it, you're guessing.",
     "start": 6.072,
     "end": 8.46
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 8.861,
   "dur": 5.748,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "One candle covers one slice of time.",
     "start": 8.861,
     "end": 11.447
    },
    {
     "text": "Inside it are four prices.",
     "start": 11.627,
     "end": 14.209
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 14.609,
   "dur": 11.192,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "The thick part is the body.",
     "start": 14.609,
     "end": 16.898
    },
    {
     "text": "It shows where price opened and where it closed.",
     "start": 17.078,
     "end": 20.332
    },
    {
     "text": "Green means it closed higher.",
     "start": 20.512,
     "end": 22.885
    },
    {
     "text": "Red means it closed lower.",
     "start": 23.065,
     "end": 25.401
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 25.801,
   "dur": 9.676,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "The thin lines are wicks.",
     "start": 25.801,
     "end": 28.038
    },
    {
     "text": "They show the highest and lowest price in that time.",
     "start": 28.218,
     "end": 31.666
    },
    {
     "text": "Colours vary by platform, so check yours.",
     "start": 31.846,
     "end": 35.077
    }
   ]
  },
